; expect 106
; BOTH modules resolve to their own declaration in the same program:
; 99 from TeamB's `bPort` plus 7 from TeamA's `aPort`.
;
; The sum is what makes this stronger than `491`. Before the fix, with
; TeamA imported first, it was 3 + 7 = 10; with TeamB first, 99 + 1 =
; 100. One winner for the whole program cannot produce 106, whichever
; module wins.
(import TeamA)

(import TeamB)

(:: main Int)

(fn (main) (+ bPort aPort))
